[00:07.96] WE DON'T WE MAKE LOVE ANYMORE
[00:10.68] WRITERS KENNY ROGERS, MARIANNE GORDON
[00:21.06] The love that we have
[00:27.55] Is not so bad
[00:32.54] Unless you think about
[00:37.74] The love that we had
[00:42.40] I don't know, who closed the door
[00:51.18] But we don't make love anymore
[01:02.84] We used to love
[01:07.89] You used to care
[01:12.73] Now it's hard to find
[01:16.78] The feeling we shared
[01:22.71] You found a way
[01:27.66] To even the score
[01:31.35] And we don't make love anymore
[01:39.96] So come lie down
[01:43.82] Beside me and talk to me
[01:51.45] Touch me with your body and your mind
[02:02.43] Help me find the feeling
[02:06.82] And push all this behind
[02:11.04] We'll make sweet, sweet love one more time
[02:22.70] But you won't try
[02:27.40] And I'll understand
[02:32.91] We'll just live our lives
[02:37.82] The best we can
[02:42.33] We turn out the lights
[02:47.29] We still lock the door
[02:50.98] But we don't make love anymore
[03:01.17] 